    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>a vector holding <ref refid="structscc_1_1sc__variable" kindref="compound">sc_variable</ref>. It can be used as a sparse array by providing a creator function or as a normal vector when providing a default value upon creating or resizing</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>after end of elaboration the size of the vector cannot be change. It is also not possible to add elements e.g. when using as a sparse array.</para>
</simplesect>
